{"id":"u-07cfb414-6698-41e6-8b73-927bb9224c79","src":"community","title":"Solider Boy Inspired Full Body Workout Plan","author":"Reyes Saúl  F.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/pOfp2a-solider-boy-inspired-full-body-workout-plan","desc":"The primary goals across community blueprints emphasize building dense traps, massive forearms, and bulletproof shoulders to realistically look like you can wield a heavy combat shield. \n\nOwn Your Rep Range: For compound lifts (e.g., Squats, Bench Press), pick a weight where you can successfully finish the minimum target reps (e.g., 6 reps) on your final set. \nPush to the Ceiling: Keep using that identical weight week after week until you can execute the maximum rep target (e.g., 12 reps) across all scheduled sets with clean, perfect form. \n\nBump the Load: Once you conquer the rep ceiling, scale up the weight by 5 to 10 pounds for your next session. Your total reps will naturally drop back down toward the lower baseline. Repeat this cycle indefinitely.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-08-02T21:44:52.762Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Shrug (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"max":1,"r":12,"rpe":8.5,"x":3}],"note":"Or Do Chin Ups 3x Max Reps"},{"n":"Farmer's Walk (Weighted)","sets":[{"sec":15,"secHi":60,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":